  "system": {
    "type": "standard",
    "description": "<p><em>A huge spider with a mocking human face spins a complex web of crystalline strings.</em></p><h3>Manifest</h3><p>The Entity materializes as a separate, physical creature on the battlefield. The creature has the stats listed by your Entity. The following rules apply:</p><ul><li><p>While within Far range, you can command the creature with a Power Trait Roll (attack, interact with environment as per GM choice).</p></li><li><p>When the creature takes damage, you must mark your Hit Points depending on the severity of the damage. You can <strong>spend an Echo</strong> to reduce the severity by one threshold; there is no other way to reduce the damage taken. After they take damage, you can choose to dismiss them.</p></li><li><p>The creature has traits and features depending on its type. Evasion and Damage Thresholds scale according to the character’s tier: Tier 1 | 2 | 3 | 4.</p></li></ul><table><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Evasion</th><th>Damage Thresholds</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>10</td><td>7/14</td></tr><tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>11</td><td>11/22</td></tr><tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>12</td><td>16/32</td></tr><tr><td>Tier 4</td><td>13</td><td>21/44</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Crystalline Lash:</strong> Very Close | <strong>d8 + Power Trait</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency</p><h3>Vessel</h3><p>The Entity inhabits your character, merging directly with your physical body. You gain the benefits listed by your Entity.</p><p><em>Chitinous limbs burst from your torso as your fingers project sharp monofilaments that anchor targets in space.</em></p><p>You can climb on walls and ceilings as easily as walking on the ground. In addition, you can make a ranged attack against a target within Far range. On a success, <strong>spend an Echo</strong> to deal <strong>d10 + Power Trait</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency and make the target become temporarily <em>Restrained</em>.</p>",
